. * nwergm tutorial 4: missing data and comparing models
. * Requires the core nwcommands and the package nwergm.
. 
. * ---- missing dyads: blank out three marriages of the Florentine families
. nwwebuse florentine, nwclear

. nwtomata flomarriage, mat(A)

. mata: A[1,2] = A[2,1] = .

. mata: A[3,5] = A[5,3] = .

. mata: A[4,9] = A[9,4] = .

. mata: st_matrix("Am", A)

. tempfile nodes

. save `nodes'
file /var/folders/hx/2zp2k5ps2y7d_6hx015fcr1h0000gn/T//S_09758.000001 saved as .dta format

. nwset, mat(Am) undirected name(flomiss)

. use `nodes', clear

. 
. nwergm flomarriage, edges nodecov(wealth)

Exponential-family random graph model

Network:               =  flomarriage
Nodes:                 =  16
Ties:                  =  20
Directed:              =  No
Estimation:            =  MPLE

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   flomarriage | Coefficient  Std. err.      z    P>|z|     [95% conf. interval]
---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
         edges |  -2.594929   .5360561    -4.84   0.000     -3.64558   -1.544278
nodecov_wealth |   .0105459   .0046743     2.26   0.024     .0013845    .0197073
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Maximum pseudolikelihood estimate (not full ERGM maximum likelihood unless the model is dyad-independent).

             Null Deviance:     166.4  on 120 degrees of freedom
         Residual Deviance:     103.1  on 118 degrees of freedom

Log-likelihood:   -51.5543 (df = 2)   AIC:     107.1   BIC:     112.7   (MC std. err. =       0)

. nwergm flomiss, edges nodecov(wealth)
Note: network flomiss has 3 missing dyad(s); they are excluded from the (pseudo)likelihood and handled as in R's ergm (m
> issing-data MCMLE).

Exponential-family random graph model

Network:               =  flomiss
Nodes:                 =  16
Ties:                  =  19
Directed:              =  No
Estimation:            =  MPLE

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
       flomiss | Coefficient  Std. err.      z    P>|z|     [95% conf. interval]
---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
         edges |  -2.692927    .552001    -4.88   0.000    -3.774829   -1.611025
nodecov_wealth |   .0111924   .0047613     2.35   0.019     .0018604    .0205244
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Maximum pseudolikelihood estimate (not full ERGM maximum likelihood unless the model is dyad-independent).

             Null Deviance:     162.2  on 117 degrees of freedom
         Residual Deviance:      98.3  on 115 degrees of freedom

Log-likelihood:   -49.1649 (df = 2)   AIC:     102.3   BIC:     107.9   (MC std. err. =       0)

. display "missing dyads: " e(nmissing) "   informative dyads: " e(N)
missing dyads: 3   informative dyads: 117

. nwergm flomiss, edges nodecov(wealth) gwesp(0.5) seed(1)
Note: network flomiss has 3 missing dyad(s); they are excluded from the (pseudo)likelihood and handled as in R's ergm (m
> issing-data MCMLE).

Exponential-family random graph model

Network:               =  flomiss
Nodes:                 =  16
Ties:                  =  19
Directed:              =  No
Estimation:            =  MCMLE
MCMC sample size:      =  3000

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
